UID:wpb-hip-sandi-light-shows-2026-12-03@awormus.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261124T143000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261203
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261231
SUMMARY:Sandi's Music & Light Shows (nightly 6–10 p.m., Dec 3–30)
LOCATION:The Great Lawn\, 100 N. Clematis Street\, West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:City events,Holiday in Paradise
DESCRIPTION:Sandi's Music & Light Shows\, as listed on the official page (retrieved 2026-11-24): FREE! Thursday\, December 3 - Wednesday\, December 30: 6 - 10 p.m.\, at The Great Lawn\, 100 N. Clematis Street. The same page's header lists special New Year's Eve hours Thursday\, December 31: 8:00 p.m. - Midnight. A "Sandi's Nightly Music & Light Shows" module on the Schedule of Holiday Events page instead lists New Year's Eve hours as 6:00 p.m. - Midnight. The body text on both versions says shows run through Dec. 31 from 6-10 p.m. and "will be extended on New Year's Eve through midnight." This calendar follows the dedicated Music & Light Shows page header for the New Year's Eve show window (8:00 p.m.-Midnight) and uses an all-day span for the regular Dec 3-30 season\; New Year's Eve is also covered on the Sandi's New Year's Eve event. NOTE: Shows start on the quarter hour except during special event nights: December 3\, 10\, 17 & 31. Sandi's Music & Light Shows will follow a modified schedule on these evenings. Shows may take place between performances or after live entertainment concludes\, with extended periods without shows. Special event showtimes are being finalized and are subject to change. On Thursday\, December 24 (Clematis by Night: No Concert)\, the No Concert event page says Sandi's Music & Light Shows and Ferris rides will still operate from 6-9:00 p.m. (see that entry). Rides on Ferris are listed as $5 per person per ride during show hours\; rules and restrictions apply (see the Ferris Wheel page). Source: Sandi's Music & Light Shows page (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Sandis-Music-Light-Shows\; Schedule of Holiday Events (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Schedule-of-Holiday-Events\; also described on the Holiday Tree Lighting event page. More info: https://wpb.org/holiday
URL:https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Sandis-Music-Light-Shows
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wpb-hip-ferris-2026-12-03@awormus.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261124T143000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261203
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261231
SUMMARY:Ferris Wheel (nightly 6–10 p.m., Dec 3–30; Dec 31 6 p.m.–midnight)
LOCATION:Waterfront Commons\, 100 N. Clematis Street\, West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:City events,Holiday in Paradise
DESCRIPTION:Ferris Wheel rides as listed on the official Ferris Wheel page (retrieved 2026-11-24): Nightly\, December 3 - 30: 6-10:00 p.m.\, with special hours December 31: 6:00 p.m. - Midnight. Tickets sold onsite. Location: Waterfront Commons\, 100 N. Clematis Street. Rides are $5 per person per ride. Rules and restrictions are listed on that page. The Holiday Tree Lighting schedule subpage adds "plus taxes and fees" to the $5 ride price\; the dedicated Ferris Wheel page does not mention taxes and fees. On Thursday\, December 24 (Clematis by Night: No Concert)\, the No Concert event page says Ferris rides will still operate from 6-9:00 p.m. (see that entry). This is an all-day span for the published December 3-30 operating dates\; December 31 special hours are also noted on the Sandi's New Year's Eve event. Source: Ferris Wheel page (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Ferris-Wheel\; also listed on the Schedule of Holiday Events (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Schedule-of-Holiday-Events. More info: https://wpb.org/holiday
URL:https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Ferris-Wheel
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wpb-hip-rhythm-rosemary-2026-12-04@awormus.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261124T143000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T210000
SUMMARY:Winter in Paradise — Rhythm on Rosemary (ReaXtion Band with DJ Scoobz) — FREE
LOCATION:Heart & Soul Park\, 825 N. Rosemary Avenue\, West Palm Beach\, FL 33401
CATEGORIES:City events,Holiday in Paradise
DESCRIPTION:Holiday in Paradise signature event. The 10th Annual Winter in Paradise — Rhythm on Rosemary in the Historic Northwest Neighborhood. The Holiday in Paradise Winter in Paradise event page (retrieved 2026-11-24) lists Friday\, December 4\, 2026\, 5-9:00 p.m.\, at Heart & Soul Park\, 825 N. Rosemary Avenue. This calendar keeps that 5-9:00 p.m. window. The Winter in Paradise featuring ReaXtion Band event page lists a When range of Friday\, December 04\, 2026\, 6:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. A Winter in Paradise module on the Schedule of Holiday Events page also says "FREE! Friday\, December 4\, 6 - 9 p.m." Those 6-9 p.m. listings are noted here\; they are not treated as a change to the 5-9:00 p.m. start printed on the HiP event page and in the Nov 9\, 2026 news release. Live entertainment: ReaXtion Band and DJ Scoobz\, confirmed on the ReaXtion event page and the schedule module. That ReaXtion page also lists Game Show Trivolution at the Sunset Lounge. Activities listed on the event page: Holiday Park Lighting\, rock climbing wall\, inflatables\, face painting\, bubble artist\, food vendors\, arts & crafts\, Beacon Ridge Capital Management Games Gig\, and live entertainment. PLUS performances by U.B. Kinsey/Palmview Elementary School of the Arts Orchestra and Band\, and the Palm Beach Lakes Community High School Ram Regiment Band. The Nov 9\, 2026 news release also listed West Palm Beach Fire Rescue free hamburgers and hot dogs and Police Department free popcorn (while supplies last)\; those details are not restated on the 2026-11-24 event pages and are kept here from that release. Free admission. Source: City news release "City Kicks Off the Holiday Season with Holiday in Paradise" (published 2026-11-09\, retrieved 2026-11-09): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/110926-HiP-kickoff\; Winter in Paradise event page (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Winter-in-Paradise-12.04.2026\; Winter in Paradise featuring ReaXtion Band and More (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Winter-in-Paradise/Winter-in-Paradise-ReaXtion-Band-12.04.2026\; Schedule of Holiday Events (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Schedule-of-Holiday-Events. More info: https://wpb.org/holiday
URL:https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Winter-in-Paradise-12.04.2026
SEQUENCE:1
END:VEVENT
