SUMMARY:Clematis by Night featuring Friday At Five — FREE
LOCATION:Great Lawn\, 100 N. Clematis Street\, West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:City events,Holiday in Paradise
DESCRIPTION:Holiday in Paradise signature event. The Friday At Five event page (retrieved 2026-11-24) lists Thursday\, December 10\, from 6-9:00 p.m.\, FREE on the Great Lawn. Genre: Party Rock\, Pop\, Country. The page describes Friday At Five as an eclectic band (examples named: AC/DC\, Lady Gaga\, Zac Brown\, Sublime)\, with a dynamic female lead vocalist and 3 male vocalists. The Schedule of Holiday Events listing gives the same date and 6-9:00 p.m. time and locates it at the West Palm Beach Waterfront\, West Palm Beach\, FL 33401\; the event detail page says Great Lawn. This calendar follows the detail page for the venue wording and keeps 100 N. Clematis Street from the Nov 9\, 2026 news release and other Clematis by Night listings. Source: City news release "City Kicks Off the Holiday Season with Holiday in Paradise" (published 2026-11-09\, retrieved 2026-11-09): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/110926-HiP-kickoff\; Friday At Five event page (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Schedule-of-Holiday-Events/Clematis-by-Night-Friday-At-Five-12.10.2026\; Schedule of Holiday Events (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Schedule-of-Holiday-Events. More info: https://wpb.org/holiday
URL:https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Schedule-of-Holiday-Events/Clematis-by-Night-Friday-At-Five-12.10.2026
