SUMMARY:Aloha Islanders Tropical Holiday Spectacular at Clematis by Night — FREE
LOCATION:NewDay USA Stage on the Waterfront Commons / Great Lawn\, 100 N. Clematis Street\, West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:City events,Holiday in Paradise
DESCRIPTION:Holiday in Paradise signature event. The Aloha Islanders Tropical Holiday Spectacular event page (retrieved 2026-11-24) lists FREE! Thursday\, December 17\, 6-9:00 p.m.\, NewDay USA Stage on the Waterfront Commons\, 100 N. Clematis Street\, and states "NEW VENUE THIS YEAR: Performance to be held at Clematis by Night." The schedule subpage lists the same date and 6-9:00 p.m. time as "FREE on the Great Lawn." This calendar records all of those printed location phrases. The event page describes an authentic Polynesian show (Hawaii\, Tahiti\, Samoa\, and New Zealand) with drums\, hula dancers\, and Samoan fire knife performers\, presented by Aloha Islanders Hawaiian Entertainment (established 1999). The Nov 9\, 2026 news release also listed a tropical Santa and an annual conch-blowing contest\; those details are not restated on the 2026-11-24 event pages and are kept here from that release. Source: City news release "City Kicks Off the Holiday Season with Holiday in Paradise" (published 2026-11-09\, retrieved 2026-11-09): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/110926-HiP-kickoff\; event page (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Aloha-Islanders-Tropical-Holiday-Spectacular-12.17.2026\; schedule subpage (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Schedule-of-Holiday-Events/Clematis-by-Night-Aloha-Islanders-Tropical-Holiday-Spectacular-12.17.2026. More info: https://wpb.org/holiday
URL:https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Aloha-Islanders-Tropical-Holiday-Spectacular-12.17.2026
