SUMMARY:Clematis by Night: No Concert (Sandi shows and Ferris 6–9 p.m.)
LOCATION:West Palm Beach Waterfront\, 100 N. Clematis Street\, West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:City events,Holiday in Paradise
DESCRIPTION:The Schedule of Holiday Events (retrieved 2026-11-24) lists "Clematis by Night: No Concert" on Thursday\, December 24\, 2026\, with the line "NO CONCERT" and "Sandi's Music & Light Shows & Ferris Wheel Still Operate on Normal Schedule." The dedicated No Concert event page says: "No Concert ~ Merry Christmas! Sandi's Music & Light Shows and Ferris rides will still operate from 6-9:00 p.m." This calendar follows that 6-9:00 p.m. operating window for December 24 and notes that the parent schedule listing says "normal schedule" (the regular nightly window printed elsewhere is 6-10:00 p.m.). The Nov 9\, 2026 Holiday in Paradise news release also stated that Clematis by Night has no event on Thursday\, Dec 24 (holiday break). This is an all-day notice that there is no concert\; no concert start time is published because there is no concert. Source: No Concert event page (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Schedule-of-Holiday-Events/Clematis-by-Night-No-Concert\; Schedule of Holiday Events (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Schedule-of-Holiday-Events\; City news release (published 2026-11-09): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/110926-HiP-kickoff.
