DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261227T220000
SUMMARY:Sandi's Ice Cream Social — FREE to attend
LOCATION:Lake Pavilion & Great Lawn\, 100 N. Clematis Street\, West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:City events,Holiday in Paradise
DESCRIPTION:Holiday in Paradise signature event. The Sandi's Ice Cream Social event page (retrieved 2026-11-24) lists Sunday\, December 27\, 6-10:00 p.m.\, with "Ice Cream Served to 9 pm\," at Lake Pavilion & Great Lawn\, 100 N. Clematis Street. The page does not print a year next to December 27\; the event URL uses 12.27.2026\, and December 27\, 2026 is a Sunday. The page says the evening includes a Silent Disco\, bubble artists\, inflatables and games\, ice cream\, and Ferris wheel rides. Ice cream and Ferris wheel rides are available for purchase. Free to attend. This updates an earlier calendar time of 6:00-9:00 p.m. taken from the Nov 9\, 2026 news release\; the official event page is 6-10:00 p.m.\, with ice cream served to 9 p.m. The Nov 9 release located the silent disco in Centennial Square (free\, first-come first-served)\; the event page names the Silent Disco but does not restate Centennial Square. That earlier location wording is kept here from the release. Source: City news release "City Kicks Off the Holiday Season with Holiday in Paradise" (published 2026-11-09\, retrieved 2026-11-09): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/110926-HiP-kickoff\; Sandi's Ice Cream Social event page (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Sandis-Ice-Cream-Social-12.27.2026. More info: https://wpb.org/holiday
URL:https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Sandis-Ice-Cream-Social-12.27.2026
