DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261231T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270101T000000
SUMMARY:Sandi's New Year's Eve with Ferris and Fireworks — FREE
LOCATION:The Great Lawn\, 100 N. Clematis Street\, West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:City events,Holiday in Paradise
DESCRIPTION:Holiday in Paradise season finale. The official event page "Sandi's New Year's Eve with Ferris & Fireworks" (retrieved 2026-11-24) lists FREE! Thursday\, December 31\, 6:00 p.m.-Midnight\, at The Great Lawn\, 100 N. Clematis Street. DJ Reflex teams up with Wonderama\, a high-energy South Florida party band (the page says the group features Grammy-winning musicians). Food and drinks available for purchase\; Ferris wheel rides available. As the clock strikes midnight\, fireworks will light up the sky with a 15-minute display over the Intracoastal Waterway\, presented by the Flagler Museum. The event page also has a "New Year's Eve Parking" heading that says "Details coming soon!" A Sandi's New Year's Eve module on the Schedule of Holiday Events page lists "FREE! Thursday\, December 31\, 8:00 p.m.-Midnight" for the same event. This calendar follows the dedicated event page's 6:00 p.m.-Midnight window. The Nov 9\, 2026 news release described Sandi shows 6 p.m.-midnight and a party 8 p.m.-midnight\; the dedicated event page does not restate an 8 p.m. party start. Sandi music and light show hours on New Year's Eve are listed separately on the Music & Light Shows page as 8:00 p.m.-Midnight (a schedule-page module for those shows instead says 6:00 p.m.-Midnight). Ferris Wheel page hours on December 31 are 6:00 p.m.-Midnight. Source: City news release "City Kicks Off the Holiday Season with Holiday in Paradise" (published 2026-11-09\, retrieved 2026-11-09): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/110926-HiP-kickoff\; event page (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Sandi’s-New-Year’s-Eve-with-Ferris-and-Fireworks\; Schedule of Holiday Events (retrieved 2026-11-24): https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Schedule-of-Holiday-Events. More info: https://wpb.org/holiday
URL:https://www.wpb.org/Residents/Community-Events/Events/Holiday-in-Paradise/Sandi’s-New-Year’s-Eve-with-Ferris-and-Fireworks
SEQUENCE:1
END:VEVENT
