DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T150000
SUMMARY:Capoeira with Mayling Pao
LOCATION:Auditorium\, 3rd floor\, Mandel Public Library of West Palm Beach\, 411 Clematis Street\, West Palm Beach\, FL 33401
CATEGORIES:Library
DESCRIPTION:Capoeira is an Afro-Brazilian practice that fuses martial art and dance. Join Mayling Pao to learn the basics and improve your flexibility and strength. No experience necessary. Please wear comfortable clothes and bring water. Meets every second and fourth Friday of the month\, generally. Source: Mandel Public Library newsletter "It's National Native American Heritage Month" (Nov 12\, 2026)\; event page (retrieved 2026-11-13): https://mandel-fl.whofi.com/calendar/event/352583
URL:https://mandel-fl.whofi.com/calendar/event/352583
