CATEGORIES:Library
DESCRIPTION:Can an AI agent cancel your subscriptions\, book your travel\, and cut your work week? Discover how new tools like Meta's Muse\, Grok\, and others take tedious chores off your plate. Join us for a live demo where we test real tasks - no coding\, no jargon\, just practical ways to put AI to work for your wallet. Organizer listed on the event page: Career and Technology Programs. Source: Mandel Public Library newsletter "It's National Native American Heritage Month" (Nov 12\, 2026)\; event page (retrieved 2026-11-13): https://mandel-fl.whofi.com/calendar/event/352587
