SUMMARY:Mandel Public Library closes early at 5 p.m.
LOCATION:Mandel Public Library of West Palm Beach\, 411 Clematis Street\, West Palm Beach\, FL
CATEGORIES:Library,City services
DESCRIPTION:As part of the Thanksgiving holiday observance\, the Mandel Public Library will be closing at 5 p.m. on Wednesday\, November 25\, 2026. The official release and related City notices do not list an opening time for that Wednesday\, so this entry marks the 5 p.m. early close only. The library is also closed Thursday\, November 26\, and Friday\, November 27\, 2026 (see the Thanksgiving holiday closure entries). The library will open at 9:30 a.m. on Saturday\, November 28\, 2026. Source: City email "Update: 112026 - Thanksgiving" (Nov 20\, 2026)\; official release "City Offices to Close in Observance of the Thanksgiving Holidays" (published 2026-11-20\, retrieved 2026-11-21): https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/112026-Thanksgiving\; also stated on the City event page "Celebrating Thanksgiving 2026" (retrieved 2026-11-21): https://www.wpb.org/Events-Folder/2026/112626-Thanksgiving-Holiday
URL:https://www.wpb.org/News-Folder/News-2026/112026-Thanksgiving
