SUMMARY:Living with Wild Neighbors (Grassy Waters Preserve)
LOCATION:Grassy Waters Nature Center\, 8264 Northlake Boulevard\, West Palm Beach\, FL 33412
CATEGORIES:City events
DESCRIPTION:A talk on backyard wildlife: learn about some of the most common native backyard visitors and how to best engage in respectful human-wildlife interactions. Reservations required: call the Nature Center at 561-804-4985. Address as listed on the City's Grassy Waters Preserve page (retrieved 2026-11-14): Grassy Waters Nature Center\, 8264 Northlake Boulevard\, West Palm Beach\, FL 33412. Source: City email "Upcoming Speakers and Film Screening!" (Nov 13\, 2026)\; Grassy Waters Preserve bulletin (sent 2026-11-13\, retrieved 2026-11-14): https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/FLWPB/bulletins/432ad0e
