SUMMARY:Homemade Holidays Series: Everglades Embroidery
LOCATION:8264 Northlake Blvd\, West Palm Beach\, FL 33412
CATEGORIES:City events
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a personalized gift? Join us to learn slow stitch embroidery and create your own ornaments and reusable gift tags! We'll introduce the basics of this meditative technique and provide the perfect\, low-stress environment to practice your new skill. Beginners welcome - all skill levels encouraged! Saturday\, December 5\, 2026\, 2:00 p.m.–4:00 p.m. Ages: 15+ (with participating adult). Cost: $20/person (plus tax) - all supplies provided. Check-in 15 mins before program start time at Nature Center. Come prepared: This will be an indoor program. Bring your creativity and holiday spirit! Reservations required\, space is limited. Please call the Nature Center to reserve a spot: 561-804-4985. Source: City email "Grassy Waters Film Screening & December Programs" (received Nov 19\, 2026)\; Public Program Calendar (retrieved 2026-11-20): https://www.wpb.org/Departments/Grassy-Waters-Preserve/Public-Program-Calendar\; program page (retrieved 2026-11-20): https://www.wpb.org/Departments/Grassy-Waters-Preserve/Public-Program-Calendar/Homemade-Holidays-Everglades-Embroidery-12526
