DESCRIPTION:Join artist Katherine Hofmann for a hands-on painting workshop exploring watercolor techniques. Participants will create two vibrant paintings inspired by Florida plants and habitats. Beginners welcome—all skill levels encouraged! Sunday\, December 6\, 2026\, 2:00 p.m.–4:00 p.m. Ages: 15 years and up (with participating adult). Cost: $30+tax (covers all supplies). Check in 30 mins before program start time at Nature Center. Come prepared: This is an indoor program. All supplies provided – bring your creativity. Reservations required\, space is limited. Please call the Nature Center to reserve a spot: 561-804-4985. Source: City email "Grassy Waters Film Screening & December Programs" (received Nov 19\, 2026)\; Public Program Calendar (retrieved 2026-11-20): https://www.wpb.org/Departments/Grassy-Waters-Preserve/Public-Program-Calendar\; program page (retrieved 2026-11-20): https://www.wpb.org/Departments/Grassy-Waters-Preserve/Public-Program-Calendar/Wetland-Watercolor-Workshop-12626
